[{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1108],"value":0},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1109],"value":4},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1110],"value":29},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1111],"value":2},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1112],"value":1},{"op":"background","image":"bg007"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",312],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「有人吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"今天店里也空无一人…。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg002"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她们一家正齐齐整整地雕着木头。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",0],"value":["call","global.namae",["％Ｅ"]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1],"value":["+","岡","崎さん"]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":18,"condition":["==",["v","s",0],["v","s",1]]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊，＄朋也君，欢迎光临。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn11e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「欢迎，冈崎同学。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「哦。事情办完哪来的就回哪吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你不用去看店吗。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak19e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「要是有客人上门，我自然会过去照看，犯不着你担心。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那就好…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哟，风子。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我在风子旁边坐下。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「啊，冈崎同学。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「今天也只干这个？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"风子还是一手木片一手小刀。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「是的，当然了。除此之外我也没什么好做的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这怎么可能呢…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"声","text":"「你好ー」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"来客人了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「嘁，真麻烦…就当我不在。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你刚还说来人就过去照看的啊！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「早苗阿姨，你不说他两句吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn21e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「秋生！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「弄出这么大的动静，装不在是瞒不过去的！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我觉得重点应该不在这里。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「可恶…也有道理。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"道理何在？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「不过啊…早苗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「我今天实在不想工作。我就想在风子旁边…安安静静地雕刻…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak26e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「我就是…这种感觉…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn15e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「秋…秋生…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不不，刚刚那并不是什么感动的对白吧，只不过是中年人在闹别扭吧？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak12e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「小子，不多这一嘴你会死啊！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大叔抓起我的衣领。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak18e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但…他样子有些奇怪。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",322],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak15e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「唔，唔哦哦哦哦ーーーーーーーーーーーー！！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"他扑倒在地翻滚起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"脚底的伤口血流如注。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak15e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「早，早苗ー！快，快帮我…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「吮一下手指！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说着把手伸了出去。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你受伤的地方是脚底吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咚！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"趁他虚弱的时候补上一脚。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn21e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「渚！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「在。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「店就麻烦你去照看一下。妈妈会照顾好秋生的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng17a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「好的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"渚站起身来。"},{"op":"choice","id":"1429:4053430","target":["v","f",1089],"items":[{"text":"跟着渚过去","value":0,"serial":4053430},{"text":"留在这里","value":1,"serial":4053440}]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":319,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我也去。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16a"]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",0],"value":["call","global.namae",["％Ｅ"]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1],"value":["+","岡","崎さん"]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":94,"condition":["==",["v","s",0],["v","s",1]]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不用，＄朋也君是我们的客人。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「怎么现在还跟我那么客气。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「好，好吧…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我说服了她，跟着往店铺那边走去。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg007"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",312],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「抱歉让您久等了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"＄渚低头一边致歉，一边来到了柜台。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"来客是…"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「小渚，你好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是伊吹姐姐。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng15a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「哇…那个…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啊，那什么来着…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咯噔。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"手忙脚乱的我和＄渚撞到了一块儿。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"伊吹姐姐吃吃地笑了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「你们关系真好。」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":122,"condition":["==",["v","f",136],0]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「是，是的…他对我很好。」"},{"op":"goto","to":126},{"op":"ifFalse","to":126,"condition":["==",["v","f",136],1]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是，是的…我们十分要好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…拜托，这么羞耻的事就不用特意强调了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「今天你们两个一起帮忙看店吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是的，因为爸爸他受伤了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「这可糟了…他没事吧？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「嗯。也不是什么很严重的伤…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"声","text":"「呜哦哦哦哦ーー！疼死我了ーーー！！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"声","text":"「拜托手再轻一点ーーー！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng26a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「唉嘿嘿…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（早苗阿姨…看起来温柔贤惠，动起手来毫不留情啊…）"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「看起来够呛。我也来帮忙吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不，不用…真的没关系。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没错，充其量是脚踩到了图钉而已。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是的。爸爸他总是很夸张。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「这样的话…那倒还好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是的，不用担心。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「给，这是托盘。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「谢谢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng25a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「这个秘密我只告诉老师。这边的面包是刚出炉的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「是吗，我占便宜了呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23az"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「给老师占个便宜。唉嘿嘿。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对话以＄渚的节奏在进行着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她们开心地挑选起面包来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（不过…让人很着急啊…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"可是…我和＄渚到底在着急些什么呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只要在这里让风子和伊吹姐姐见上一面…所有问题不就都迎刃而解了吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我不禁这么想到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是…风子说这是钻空子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她说钻这种空子肯定没用。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"难道就不能确认一下吗…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"难道确认…会伤害到谁吗…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我陷入了迷茫。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「老师买了好多呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「是啊。因为不止我一个人吃。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「这是两人份的午餐。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这是…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我强装平静地问。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",315],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「小风她最喜欢这里的面包了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「休息天的时候，我总会来这里买面包。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「回到家里，把她叫醒…然后一起吃午餐。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「虽然我不知道她会不会醒…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「但我不能因此就只买一人份。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「因为说不定，哪天她就醒了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「或许是今天，又或许是明天。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…我得说些什么才行。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我得掩饰好自己的动摇，设法安慰她才行。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我得装出一副不认识风子的样子才行…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「她一定…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"＄渚先开口了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng35a"]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",322],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「她一地灰醒的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"都泣不成声了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（你动摇得太明显了！）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我背对着伊吹姐姐，在＄渚耳边小声说到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"（可是…我从没听到过…这么悲伤的故事…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（你别说话了。）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"（我不说话，就没法看店了…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（不用了。就让我来看店。）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"（对不起…）"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng33a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"＄渚默默地站着，强忍住眼眶中的泪水。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"人在微微颤抖。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（喂，你也太明显了…）"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「小渚，你怎么啦？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我猜是急着要上厕所吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「是吗？不用管我，你快去吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她摇摇头。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng35a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"泪水从眼眶滑落。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「小渚！？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（＄渚，行了，你就装去上厕所，回屋里去。）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"（好，好的…拜托了。）"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng33a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「老师，对不起，我先走了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她一边抹着眼泪，一边往里走去。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko13"]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",312],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「小渚她…不要紧吧…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（呜哇，一定是当她那么大还尿裤子了…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那家伙…很容易哭鼻子。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也不知道这句话算不算得上是圆场。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「就这些是吗。那我算账了哦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「嗯，麻烦你了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我在收银台前站定。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（等等…我不知道单价…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（就当是全部商品５０日元的特价日吧…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（但就算这样…要不要再算上消费税我都不知道…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（唔…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「恭喜这位客人。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「咦？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「今天全品免单。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「开玩笑吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是真的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「看来你不知道单价吧。要不我告诉你？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好的…对不起。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…被看穿了。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg001"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「现在是要去探望妹妹吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「是的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那家伙…不对，你妹妹她…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「真的…在那里吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「咦？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"刚问出口，我就后悔了。会问出这种问题的只可能是怪人。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",315],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「你问的问题很奇怪呢…你是冈崎同学吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是的，我叫冈崎。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「奇怪的冈崎同学。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"伊吹姐姐笑了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（啊啊，姐妹都给我打上了怪人的烙印…）"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「她在啊，一直都在那里。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那个…伊吹…不，我可以称呼你公子老师吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「嗯，当然。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那好，公子老师。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"公子","text":"「嗯。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「请你一定要坚强。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「只要不放弃这份信念…总有一天会迎来妹妹醒来的那一天…一定会。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也不知道我为什么要说这些。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我真的不知道。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"公子","text":"「那我告辞了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「慢走。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"和她道别…看着她的背影，我想通了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（我不讨厌这个人…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这就是原因。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"和＄渚一样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（话说要是我能早入学一年，就能上到她的课了…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（可恶…亏大了。）"},{"op":"background","image":"bg002"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn20e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「麻烦你了，冈崎同学。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"回到屋里，早苗阿姨向我低头致意。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，不麻烦…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我没看到＄渚和大叔。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"风子还自顾自在雕刻。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「刚刚过来的客人…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是伊吹公子老师。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我故意说给风子听到。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「这样啊。没能出去接待她真是不好意思。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「过后我给她打个电话吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你们很熟吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn11e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「当然了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"早苗阿姨笑着答到。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"早苗阿姨和公子老师站在一起的场面…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…我有点无法想象。"},{"op":"goto","to":458},{"op":"ifFalse","to":458,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我决定留在这里。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那我专心去看店了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"＄渚走了出去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"早苗阿姨也走出了房间，然后拿回一个急救箱。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从里面拿出小瓶子，镊子和棉球。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「我要涂红药水了哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「好，好的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"早苗阿姨用镊子夹起棉球，蘸了蘸红药水，然后涂在大叔的脚底。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn11e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「疼的话要说哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"接着，她的手突然高速运转起来，给整个伤处涂满了红药水。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak16e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「呜哦哦哦哦ーー！疼死我了ーーー！！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn11e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「很疼呀。不过要忍一忍哦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak15e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「拜托手再轻一点ーーー！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn11e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「不行。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（早苗阿姨，动起手来毫不留情啊…）"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",0],"value":["call","global.namae",["％Ｅ"]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1],"value":["+","岡","崎さん"]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":347,"condition":["==",["v","s",0],["v","s",1]]},{"op":"text","speaker":"声","text":"「那个，＄朋也君。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"转头一看，＄渚正从门缝里探出头来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「怎么了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「要麻烦你帮个忙…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看到她向我招手，我站起身来。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg006"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",312],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16az"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是伊吹老师。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「怎么？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「外面的客人是伊吹老师。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不会吧…？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「所以我不知道怎么办才好…人一紧张就…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「怎么了…你该不会把风子的事给说漏嘴了吧…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng18a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「没有…就是头撞到了货架。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她撩起刘海，露出撞得通红的额头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没事没事。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我摸了摸她肿起来的地方。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「谢谢你。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「现在她正在挑面包…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16az"]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",0],"value":["call","global.namae",["％Ｅ"]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1],"value":["+","岡","崎さん"]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":374,"condition":["==",["v","s",0],["v","s",1]]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「＄朋也君可以来陪我吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「只有我一个人的话…我不知道会不会说错话…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「拜托了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「真是拿你没辙…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我跟着＄渚来到了外面。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg007"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不好意思，让您久等了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「没事，正好让我慢慢挑选。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你好。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「冈崎同学也在呀。你好。」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":420,"condition":["==",["v","f",136],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「你们关系真好。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「是，是的…他对我很好。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「今天你们两个一起帮忙看店吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「是的，因为爸爸他受伤了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「原来刚才的喊声是这么回事啊。他没事吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，刚才的喊声是给他处理伤口时发出的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「是早苗小姐吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我点点头，伊吹姐姐笑了起来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「受的伤不要紧吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「爸爸他总是很夸张。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「你们日子总是过得很开心，真好呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「爸爸总是很吵。有点打扰到邻居们了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我在一旁看着伊吹姐姐的笑容，脑子里闪过一个想法。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只要在这里让风子和伊吹姐姐见上一面…所有问题不就都迎刃而解了吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是…风子说这是钻空子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她说钻这种空子肯定没用。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"难道就不能确认一下吗…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"难道确认…会伤害到谁吗…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我陷入了迷茫。"},{"op":"goto","to":173},{"op":"goto","to":458},{"op":"ifFalse","to":458,"condition":["==",["v","f",136],1]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「小渚还特意把男朋友带出来，真是会秀恩爱呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不，不是这样的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「因为朋也君也想和老师熟悉一下。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「是吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是的。请老师不要嫌弃。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「哪里，请你不要嫌弃才是。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我看着伊吹姐姐的笑容出神。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只要在这里让风子和伊吹姐姐见上一面…所有问题不就都迎刃而解了吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这个念头从我脑中闪过。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是…风子说这是钻空子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她说钻这种空子肯定没用。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"难道就不能确认一下吗…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"难道确认…会伤害到谁吗…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我陷入了迷茫。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「朋也君…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我眼角的余光好像看到渚在摆手。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啊？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「你看得太入神了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「咦？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那个…我说的熟悉一下，应该不是指这个样子…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…她好像吃醋了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那个…是我误会了吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你误会了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊…是我太想当然了…真对不起。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好啦，没事。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"渚转向伊吹姐姐寒暄起来。"},{"op":"goto","to":173},{"op":"background","image":"bg002n1"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",313],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"日落西山，店铺打烊准备晚餐，这是古河家最忙碌的时候。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",0],"value":["call","global.namae",["％Ｅ"]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1],"value":["+","岡","崎さん"]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":466,"condition":["==",["v","s",0],["v","s",1]]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「＄朋也君也留下吃晚饭吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那我去帮忙做晚饭，先离开一下。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"＄渚站起身，走出了房间。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"房间里就只剩我和风子两个人了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一刀…一刀…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"风子一直在进行着雕刻。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（我该怎么办呢…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也没人陪我说话。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"木雕的声音停下了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu21a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我看过去，风子正轻轻抚摸着自己刚完成的海星木雕。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「又做好了一个。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「是的，这是到现在为止最可爱的一个。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我看不出这个跟地上摆的那些有什么区别啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu20a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「手的平衡感掌握得非常好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我觉得没了这些手反而会更可爱。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu17a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「那就变成一个圆球了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「但就是比海星要好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「会有人觉得一个圆球比海星可爱吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我觉得这句话反过来才说得通…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu18a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「你真没礼貌。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你就那么看不起返璞归真的圆球吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「一个圆球掉在地上也没人会去捡的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那要是海星掉了，你会去捡吗…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu20a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「别说捡了，我会把它抱起来。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…我睡了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我面朝墙壁躺下了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「不要话说到一半就睡呀。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我们价值观偏差太远，没什么可说的了」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu33a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「你真的太没礼貌了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我身边怎么都是些有奇怪癖好的人呢。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":512,"condition":["==",["v","f",138],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（下次让＄渚和这家伙辩论一下，到底是团子大家族还是海星更可爱吧…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（感觉这场辩论没有终点…）"},{"op":"goto","to":533},{"op":"ifFalse","to":533,"condition":["==",["v","f",138],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（究竟是团子大家族还是海星更可爱，分个高下吧…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（大概是这种感觉…）"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",321],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng17a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「团子很可爱，还有一首歌。海星不可爱，所以没有歌。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu33"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「好没礼貌，海星也是有歌的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng17a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那就唱来听听吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu33"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「好的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「YO！我生于东京湾，长在防波堤，只要你长一双手，我们就是好朋友。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng33a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「这首歌是抄袭的。」"},{"op":"background","image":"bg002n1"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因此这一战判团子获胜。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",313],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（脑子里居然是嘻哈梗…我居然和春原是一类人吗…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"干脆一觉睡到晚饭算了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（不，等等…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我突然改了主意。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（现在不就是和风子说话的千载良机吗…？）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（这家伙到这个家来后，就一直雕着东西…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「真是的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我不情不愿地坐起身，转身朝向风子的方向。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",322],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgfu34a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"风子","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她已经去到了别的世界。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「真是的…难得我有心想陪你说两句…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…看来说什么都没用了。"},{"op":"callScene","scene":1009,"entry":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"接着，我吃完晚饭，就准备闪人了。"},{"op":"jumpScene","scene":1430,"entry":0},{"op":"return"}]